 "title": "Does weighted belief aggregation actually beat naive majority on a scored gold set",
 "question": "The runtime offers weighted and Bayesian aggregation at :10930; on this program's own decision corpus, do they outperform an unweighted majority, and by how much?",
 "spec_anchor": "_USER-PROMPTS.md:10930",
